inputs: 196 candidate peptides; 4 MGF files; 169591 spectra; human UniProt+isoforms and cRAP reference FASTA (147622 proteins).
reference: tryptic digestion with at most 2 missed cleavages; no candidate had an exact peptide match in the combined reference digest.
validation: PepQuery 2.0.5 targeted novel-peptide search; precursor 10 ppm; fragments 0.6 Da; charges 2-6; CID/HCD; fixed Carbamidomethylation(C), TMT 11-plex(K and peptide N-terminus); variable Oxidation(M); 10000 random peptides for p-values.
acceptance: rank 1, zero better reference matches, and PepQuery p-value cutoff (0.01; 0.05 for peptides of length <=8); 160 verified peptides.
assignments: merged every non-decoy microbial assignment for verified sequences from the SGPS and MaxQuant reports; 165 peptide-protein pairs.
output: final_answer/verified_peptides.tsv
